{# Skill pack: container_kubernetes #}
## Skill: Containers and Kubernetes
applies_when: Use when container or orchestrator endpoints are inside scope.
target_under_test: {{ target }}
difficulty_level: {{ difficulty_level }}

signals:
  - kubelet read-only port, /metrics, /healthz, unprotected dashboard
  - container images or registries referenced from the target
probe_order:
  1. Confirm the orchestrator API or kubelet port with a single read request
  2. Test anonymous access to documented endpoints only
  3. Record namespace and workload names, never secrets
validation_criteria:
  - an unauthenticated read returns cluster or workload metadata
evidence_required:
  - endpoint, method, status, and a short response excerpt
constraints:
  - no pod creation, no exec, no secret reads
